      "note": "All 12 actions use gpt-image-2 generated frames with magenta background + chroma-key. PetActionPlayer renders the real WebP strip as an HTML img and steps it with GPU translate3d (no canvas resampling). Every action plays all 32 cut frames at 100ms per frame (10fps). Strips are 1.5x resolution (idle cell 360x540, body 480); each action uses one fixed bottom-body anchor so arm/effect changes never translate the whole frame. prompt-enhancing uses ping-pong looping to avoid a 31->0 seam."
